Fixes #63.

With this pr we add the support of custom parsers based on the content type.
The `application/json` is always handled by fastify, in this way we have a fast case for the most common use case and we don't add overhead.

Usage:
```js
fastify.addParseStrategy('application/jsoff', function (req, done) {
  myCustomParser(req, function (err, body) {
    done(err || body)
  })
})
```
